                                <br/>
                            </h1>
                            <ul class="lead">
                                    <t t-set="categories" t-value="('a','b','c','d','f')"/>
                                <t t-foreach="categories" t-as="cat">
                                   <li>
                                    <a t-att-href="'/books/category/' + cat"><t t-esc="cat"/>dkjk</a>
                                </li>
                                </t>
                                <li>
                                    <a href="/shop/category/book-guaide-promotion-guide-61">গাইড</a>
                                </li>
                                <li>
                                    <a href="/shop/category/book-police-hand-book-4">হ্যান্ডবুক</a>
                                </li>
                                <li>
                                    <a href="/shop/category/57">দন্ডবিধি</a>
                                </li>
                                <li>
                                    <a href="/shop/category/58">ফৌজদারি কার্যবিধি</a>
                                </li>
                                <li>
                                    <a href="/shop/category/59">সাক্ষ আইন</a>
                                </li>
                                <li>
                                    <a href="/shop/category/book-minor-acts-101">মাইনর এ্যক্টস&amp;nbsp;</a>
                                    <br/>
                                </li>
                            </ul>
                            <p>
                                <a class="btn btn-lg btn-primary" href="/contactus">
                                    Come Visit Us
                                    <i class="fa fa-angle-right"/>
                                </a>
                            </p>
                        </div>
                        <div class="o_grid_item o_grid_item_image d-lg-block d-none o_snippet_mobile_invisible o_colored_level g-height-6 g-col-lg-5 col-lg-5 o_anim_fade_in o_animate o_visible"
                             style="z-index: 2; grid-area: 1 / 7 / 7 / 12;" data-invisible="1">
                            <a href="https://www.khan-store.com/shop/category/1">
                                <img src="/web/image/21047-9a83e45f/book%20shelf.webp" alt=""
                                     class="img img-fluid mx-auto o_we_custom_image rounded" data-mimetype="image/webp"
                                     data-original-id="21046"
                                     data-original-src="/web/image/21046-ad197d67/book%20shelf.jpg"
                                     data-mimetype-before-conversion="image/jpeg" data-resize-width="NaN"
                                     loading="eager"/>
                            </a>
                        </div>
                        <div class="o_grid_item o_grid_item_image g-col-lg-2 g-height-5 col-lg-2 d-lg-block d-none o_snippet_mobile_invisible o_colored_level"
                             style="z-index: 3; grid-area: 2 / 11 / 7 / 13;" data-invisible="1">
                            <a href="/shop/category/book-guaide-promotion-guide-inspectorship-95">
                                <img src="/web/image/21062-7e517dd4/inspectorship_guide_rakhal.webp" alt=""
                                     class="img img-fluid mx-auto rounded o_we_custom_image" data-mimetype="image/webp"
                                     data-original-id="21048"
                                     data-original-src="/web/image/21048-347ea583/inspectorship_guide_rakhal.png"
                                     data-mimetype-before-conversion="image/png" data-resize-width="NaN"
                                     loading="lazy"/>
                            </a>
                        </div>
                        <div class="o_grid_item g-col-lg-5 g-height-4 col-lg-5 o_colored_level"
                             style="z-index: 4; grid-area: 6 / 6 / 10 / 11;">
                            <blockquote
                                    class="s_blockquote s_blockquote_with_line o_cc o_cc1 o_animable position-relative d-flex flex-column gap-4 w-100 mx-auto p-4 fst-normal shadow"
                                    data-vcss="001" data-snippet="s_blockquote" data-name="Blockquote">
                                <div class="s_blockquote_line_elt position-absolute top-0 start-0 bottom-0 bg-o-color-1"/>
                                <div class="s_blockquote_wrap_icon position-absolute top-0 start-50 translate-middle w-100">
                                    <i class="s_blockquote_icon fa fa-quote-right d-block mx-auto rounded bg-o-color-1"
                                       role="img"/>
                                </div>
                                <p class="s_blockquote_quote my-auto">
                                    "This bookstore is a delightful escape. Each visit reveals new stories waiting to be
                                    discovered!"
                                </p>
                                <div class="s_blockquote_infos d-flex gap-2 flex-row align-items-start justify-content-start w-100 text-start">
                                    <img src="/web/image/website.s_blockquote_default_image"
                                         class="s_blockquote_avatar img rounded-circle" alt="" loading="lazy"/>
                                    <div class="s_blockquote_author">
                                        <span class="o_small">
                                            <strong>James Thompson</strong>
                                            <br/>
                                            Mystery Lover
                                        </span>
                                    </div>
                                </div>
                            </blockquote>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="oe_structure">
                    <section class="s_title parallax s_parallax_is_fixed bg-black-50 pt24 pb24" data-vcss="001"
                             data-snippet="s_title" data-scroll-background-ratio="1">
                        <span class="s_parallax_bg oe_img_bg"
                              style="background-image: url('/web/image/website.s_parallax_default_image'); background-position: 50% 0;"/>
                        <div class="o_we_bg_filter bg-black-50"/>
                        <div class="container">
                            <h1>Services</h1>
                        </div>
                    </section>
                </div>
                <div class="oe_structure"/>
            </div>
        </t>
    </template>

</odoo>